<title>USA: State Bancorp declares 6-for-5 stock split.</title>
<headline>State Bancorp declares 6-for-5 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HYDE PARK, N.Y. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Bancorp Inc, parent of State Bank of Long Island, on Tuesday said it declared a six-for-five stock split and a $0.12 per share quarterly dividend.</p>
<p>The company said both the stock and cash dividends will be paid July 3 to shareholders of record June 13.</p>
